  *     |               Pin assignment for M24CXX EEPROM                 |
  *     +---------------------------------------+-----------+-------------+
  *     |  STM32F1xx I2C Pins                   |   EEPROM  |   Pin       |
  *     +---------------------------------------+-----------+-------------+
